Attribution
-----------

The analysis of the .qsv container format that this program depends on — the
header and index-record layout, and the two obfuscation schemes — is the work
of btnkij (https://github.com/btnkij/qsv2flv), who published it as a Windows
application together with the reverse-engineering notes in that project's
secret/ directory. docs/QsvFormat.md is a rewritten and extended account of
that analysis, and docs/PortingNotes.md records where this implementation
departs from the original's behaviour.

That project carries no licence file, so this notice is a credit rather than a
claim about its terms. The code in this repository is an independent
implementation: the container parser, the remuxer, both front ends, the build
system and the test suite were written for this project. What is shared with
the original is knowledge of a file format — the field offsets and the
obfuscation algorithms — which the notes above set out as fact rather than as
copied source.
